<title>HUNGARY: Hungary prelim C/A gap for Aug is $100 mln - NBH.</title>
<headline>Hungary prelim C/A gap for Aug is $100 mln - NBH.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's current account deficit widened by $100 million in August according to a preliminary figure published by the National Bank of Hungary on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Figures previously published by the NBH put the cumulative C/A gap at $937 million for January through July.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom ++ 36 1 327 4040</p>
